 from them.","flow":[{"label":"Documents Uploaded"},{"label":"Indexed","note":"Pinecone"},{"label":"Retrieval","note":"LangChain"},{"label":"Answer","note":"Groq"}],"stack":["LangChain","Pinecone","Groq","Next.js"],"outcomes":["Faster answers from your own documents","Responses tied to source material"],"visual":"chat","featured":true}}],["$","$Lb","daveys-plumbing",{"project":{"slug":"daveys-plumbing","title":"24/7 AI Voice Agent for Davey's Plumbing","featuredTitle":"Davey's Plumbing: 24/7 AI Voice Agent","category":"Voice AI","industry":"Plumbing & home services (United States)","summary":"An inbound voice agent that answers every call, troubleshoots common issues, books jobs and hands over to a person when needed.","problem":"Calls arriving after hours or while the team was on a job went unanswered, so leads went to competitors and booking relied on staff being free.","built":"An AI voice agent that answers every call, troubleshoots common issues from a knowledge base, books appointments through the Joober API, and transfers to a person when needed.","how":"Each call is answered instantly. The agent qualifies the customer, checks the knowledge base for common issues, books an appointment straight into Joober, and transfers to a human when the situation calls for it.","flow":[{"label":"Incoming Call","note":"Answered at any hour"},{"label":"AI Voice Agent","note":"Troubleshoots from a knowledge base"},{"label":"Customer Qualification","note":"Captures details and urgency"},{"label":"Joober Appointment Booking","note":"Booked via the Joober API"},{"label":"Human Handoff When Needed","note":"Transfers to staff"}],"stack":["VAPI","GPT-4","Python FastAPI","Joober API"],"outcomes":["No missed calls or lost leads outside office hours","Appointments land directly in the scheduling system, with no re-entry","Staff stay on jobs instead of answering the phone","Coverage around the clock without hiring extra call handlers"],"results":[{"value":"0","label":"missed calls after hours"},{"value":"24/7","label":"call handling"},{"value":"3 weeks","label":"to deploy"},{"value":"100%","label":"calls captured and logged"}],"visual":"call","wide":true,"featured":true}}],["$","$Lb","ai-voice-receptionist",{"project":{"slug":"ai-voice-receptionist","title":"AI Voice Receptionist","category":"Voice AI","summary":"First-line call handling that answers common questions, takes caller details, and books meetings or callbacks.","problem":"Routine calls take up staff time, and calls outside working hours go unanswered.","built":"A voice agent that answers common questions, takes the caller’s details, and books meetings or callbacks.","how":"The agent picks up, answers from approved information, collects the caller’s details and books a meeting or callback.","flow":[{"label":"Incoming Call"},{"label":"Speech to Text","note":"Deepgram"},{"label":"Conversation","note":"GPT-4o"},{"label":"Voice Reply","note":"ElevenLabs"},{"label":"Meeting or Callback Booked"}],"stack":["VAPI","GPT-4o","ElevenLabs","Deepgram"],"outcomes":["Callers get an answer instead of voicemail","Staff only handle calls that need a person","Callbacks and meetings are booked automatically"],"visual":"call"}}]]}]]}],["$","$L9",null,{"className":"rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0D0D0D] p-8 sm:p-12","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-3 font-syne text-[1.6rem] font-extrabold leading-[1.2] text-white","children":"Have a similar problem to solve?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-7 max-w-[520px] font-dm text-[15.5px] leading-[1.7] text-white/65","children":"Tell us about the workflow slowing your team down. We’ll map it and agree the metrics up front."}],["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#00D68F] px-7 py-3.5 font-syne text-[13px] font-bold text-[#0A0A0A] transition-colors hover:bg-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#00D68F]","children":["Start wi